<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants continue attacks on civilians around Macomia, forcing peasant farmers to abandon fields and limiting humanitarian access. Opposition leader Mondlane reported state abuses during a Supreme Court trial while the government advances a large LNG megaproject and DP World port expansion. A campaign to mobilise people to &amp;quot;take power&amp;quot; is being used to influence decisions. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE1xNkxaRW04RWpkc1RrOV9zNW1GeGVWVUlxdEVWSzlGTHJSRi13enF4S2QyOElKcktSazdzYWFmNl9Kbkh6dVpBQmVWTG44akV3NkFxUGhpVzVpTjhaaGtNbnZWZl9ZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNM1RwNFlENnl5ZGtxSE0yS3hiOUs2WEoycFpkZjZzbGpybXBxbFRhZ1dSN0tEVFlDUFh3RDRrUzhsNXIyc0ZoTk1fNnd2OTVQYXhfdDRONHo0a3hxUUlXN3hyS3lfT0xIVDJocUhiNWhsS0VrTXNDUldnQko4VjV1eDA5RExQbWhFd0JDMGlNMHQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Macau Business&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOc25peV9rSHJxcFRKWmE0WjJoNUVoZUw0QkMtbVJqeUM5bjUxS0FEYks5U05kN0pqWXhxSzhxSENOTWk1XzJkcDV3RFdBc2oyYmdLQk9NcEdENmFheEd3Zjg2dFNVSjVvdm8tYUxwVWE2cktMdHlYZkExRU5Qd29XeTN6ZGVZejRJTzFySElrQW1KaHVick41cUhiZ2VnbUlDb2l0d1hyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOVWNQbXNkZEFXR3M2TzFRVERqOGQ0UjVOVmk2ajJ1TlFobmp6aUhxVXhlSXVVTzRLU0tQdFRuTndWNy1VZE5oLUxBWjVDN2JDTzdEMEQzU3hiNmhGOVF6M0NGcVNtcGhhRm80UjBBYWJHM1dnYnpnOHNqaDgzU01ZaFFtcEQ5T2Y4a3NNX19QSmxZTVg4bi1oaEJwUlRkWXMtT1pndldSLVNFOVRiT2ZNOGo0UjlzaDJDb0cybl9HTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channel Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxONi0